cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper below."
title: "Executable Tool-Contract Conformance Testing for Agentic Benchmarks"
abstract: >-
  Replication artifact for an executable-contract audit of four tool-using
  agent benchmarks. Contains the contract specification language and its
  validator, the static and dynamic conformance checkers, per-benchmark
  adapters, the mutation-validation harness, the pre-registered analysis
  plans, and every generated report table.
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
